      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Effects of exercise on tricuspid annular motion at the right ventricular free wall was studied by echocardiography. The results suggest that exercise-related reversible changes in tricuspid annular motion may be used to identify patients with proximal right coronary artery stenosis."},
